# Extra glslc flags for this repo's shaders. Read by cbuild --vulkan
# (/home/coopa/.sww/packages/cbuild/cbuild). One token per line.
#
# ui.vert includes <gfx/surface2d/quad_vs.glsl> from gfxcoopa's base shader library.
# The CMake build doesn't read this file: gfx_add_shader_target() adds both directories
# to -I itself.
#
# Paths are RELATIVE to the repo root -- cbuild invokes glslc with cwd=repo root. The
# gfxcoopa entry works both standalone (~/git/uicoopa) and vendored under another
# project's libs/, since either way gfxcoopa is a sibling.
#
# ORDER MATTERS and matches gfx_add_shader_target(): this repo's own shader dir first,
# then gfxcoopa's base library. glslc searches -I in order.
#
# The world-space UI fragment shaders include ui_world_occlude.glsl with a QUOTED
# include, which glslc resolves relative to the including file.
-I
assets/shaders
-I
../gfxcoopa/assets/shaders
